<title>USA: Stock markets to close early Nov. 29, Dec. 24.</title>
<headline>Stock markets to close early Nov. 29, Dec. 24.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange, the American Stock Exchange and the Nasdaq market will close early, at 1 p.m. EST, on Nov. 29 and Dec. 24.</p>
<p>The markets will be closed on Thursday, Nov. 28, for the Thanksgiving Day holiday and on Wednesday, Dec. 25, Christmas Day.</p>
